The wheel is a single extension module with every crate below compiled into it,
so their terms travel with the binary. The project's own licence is `LICENSE`,
beside this file.

Section 3.2(a) of the Mozilla Public License 2.0 asks that recipients be told how
to obtain the source form of the files it covers. Every crate below is published
on `crates.io`, its unmodified source is at
`https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>`, and the repository it was published
from is named beside it. None of them is patched here.

